<title>THAILAND: First Bangkok unaudited Q3 profits jump.</title>
<headline>First Bangkok unaudited Q3 profits jump.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Bangkok City Bank said on Friday its unaudited third quarter net profits for 1996 jumped 48 percent to 442.8 million baht (US$18 million).</p>
<p>For the nine months, the unaudited net profit was 3.43 billion baht, up 26 percent from 2.73 billion baht posted in the corresponding period in 1995.</p>
</text>
